(On completing this material, you should be able to:) Tj
T* (- Describe the PLFS survey design, including sample design and rotating panel for urban areas.) Tj
T* (- Define and compute LFPR, WPR, and unemployment rate under different reference periods.) Tj
T* (- Distinguish between UPS, UPSS, CWS, and CDS measures and explain when each is appropriate.) Tj
T* (- Compare PLFS with the earlier NSSO Employment-Unemployment Survey.) Tj
T* (- Identify data quality considerations in interpreting PLFS estimates.) Tj
